hat you have been explicitly authorized to access\n- Returns the complete file content as a string\n- Use this to analyze the current state before deciding what changes to make', 'parameters': {'properties': {'file_path': {'description': "Absolute path to the file to read (e.g., '/path/to/file.clab.yml' or '/path/to/config.json').", 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['file_path'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'modify_file_tool', 'description': 'Modifies a file by writing new content to it.\n\nUse this tool to fix YAML or JSON configuration files after analyzing errors.\nThe tool will overwrite the file with the new content.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Provide the COMPLETE new content of the file, not just a diff\n- Ensure YAML/JSON syntax is correct before using this tool\n- Use proper indentation (2 spaces for YAML)\n- For YAML files, ensure all quotes and special characters are properly escaped', 'parameters': {'properties': {'file_path': {'description': "Absolute path to the file to modify (e.g., '/path/to/file.clab.yml' or '/path/to/config.json').", 'type': 'string'}, 'new_content': {'description': 'The new complete content to write to the file. This should be the full file content, not a patch.', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['file_path', 'new_content'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'YamlFixResult', 'description': 'YAML 修复 Agent 的返回结构（用于 validator/deployer/configurator 错误）', 'parameters': {'properties': {'changes_summary': {'description': '修改内容摘要', 'type': 'string'}, 'files_modified': {'description': '修改的文件路径列表', 'items': {'type': 'string'}, 'type': 'array'}}, 'required': ['changes_summary', 'files_modified'], 'type': 'object'}}}]}} | openai._base_client:_build_request:482
